{
  "slug": "first-tallyprime-sync-verification",
  "title": "How to Verify Your First TallyPrime Sync",
  "description": "Confirm that Syncora shows the right company and matches a known TallyPrime transaction before you rely on the dashboard.",
  "category": "Setup",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Pick two records before syncing",
      "body": "On the Windows PC, open the company you intend to connect. Write down a recent voucher type, number, date, party and amount. Choose one customer ledger with a transaction you can recognize. Save these details locally as your reference."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Make the first comparison",
      "body": "After the connector reports a successful run, select the same company in Syncora. Set a date range that includes your reference voucher. Compare the voucher details first, then open the reference ledger and confirm the same transaction appears there."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Record what you verified",
      "body": "Note the company and successful sync time. If the voucher is missing but the company appears, check the financial-year and date filters. If both reference records disagree after the next successful run, send the comparison and connector version to support."
    }
  ],
  "relatedPaths": [
    "/guides/tallyprime-setup",
    "/product-overview"
  ]
}
